 703:Src/main.c    **** /* ================================================================
 704:Src/main.c    ****    SECTION 11: DWT CYCLE COUNTER INIT (for wake-up latency)
 705:Src/main.c    ****    ================================================================
 706:Src/main.c    ****    Initializes the DWT (Data Watchpoint and Trace) cycle counter.
 707:Src/main.c    ****    Provides microsecond-resolution timing via DWT->CYCCNT.
 708:Src/main.c    ****    Required by LP_TRACE_WAKEUP_LATENCY_US.
